00:57:19.090 --> 00:57:29.310
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Torey Malatia. And he called everybody on staff to find out how they all spent this year's annual bonus. He just gave me a report--
<v Ira Glass>一如既往地感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚。他给全体员工打电话，想了解他们每个人是如何花掉今年的年度奖金的。他刚给了我一份报告——

00:57:29.310 --> 00:57:36.270
<v Allan Obiero>--so some of them are drunkards, so they used it to buy alcohol. Others just spent the whole amount on food and became fat.
<v Allan Obiero>——所以有些人是酒鬼，所以他们用了它去买酒精。其他人只是把整笔钱花在食物上，吃成了胖子。

00:57:36.270 --> 00:57:40.590
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《这个美国生活》的故事。

